 25++ 0000              ; Driver result convention:
 26++ 0000              ;   Carry clear = operation completed.
 27++ 0000              ;   Carry set   = timeout.
 28++ 0000              ;   A           = last observed GSSTAT on timeout / final status on wait.
 29++ 0000              ;   p126_ipc_last_status always contains the last sampled GSSTAT byte.
